", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974652_377975942018244_1397951637765943249_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C6cYfmVX848Q7kNvwFhi11h&_nc_oc=AdnIWVKLhtH5Idu6eHzvZxQguxXchxoC0HZ3uYsYDntJVykC_smCjOZqpSCDTtK6cyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfsA4MIwt9Vi247MCuyANxDsWobpOgrnuEnWJXtXSIBPeg&oe=69A80F38"}]}, "id": "1875306759751362", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "[3-7]3.png", "id": "674175618367199", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_674175621700532_8169139035188750477_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BZKIq-3SOhcQ7kNvwHupz0I&_nc_oc=AdmZCvXxlTdZ09OERBTJBnTKmOlPTopJK_PNFwGEIePWCT-PwG4riBkIdgVbqbTi_IE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftlMFqr-d0VtclruHJyGitXIXGGQWRbjiZmZ4piBttXOQ&oe=69A82D0E"}, {"file_name": "[3-7]4.png", "id": "1151230583174978", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391893_1151230586508311_7939786717015308543_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KyhzBMPAxdQQ7kNvwHvg52R&_nc_oc=AdkygeH91PCwbN9RBcQRBfnQYlYGvbEX2A3EfaupOt-UChICxoUx5zWQlgoGZ65koO4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftDT4hfCslF69xnefRETbXLnXeBh7BngHb0ej7bF1Y5qg&oe=69A815F4"}, {"file_name": "9.png", "id": "1260656168806820", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499321679_1260656172140153_1960819854579126765_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hJ7sNA31QbgQ7kNvwEAW-K_&_nc_oc=AdkrmWqavUbBbMy1gRSXp_p6b0s5W5-YnW4ebXS_kgv-dKXdRnFjAlqRO7W5q-sz3hM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuWMxOIl1j8JDiG72O-t4i5crNw_qLCJqXVSwhqakgjMA&oe=69A81135"}, {"file_name": "[3-7]2.png", "id": "591982036994214", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391883_591982040327547_2472079098602001949_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=504Lxf401GkQ7kNvwElr3GI&_nc_oc=AdljJObnZs47Cl-sE3YQG9UrCBaiyTPeUoXoG5q2GSZaLQUaUYaHcgMprBkmExU5aII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuZ4B0HO8Mr8qqXjVLkY5q1tcCEwilhmLoTsVVxr9zrcQ&oe=69A82BE9"}, {"file_name": "10.png", "id": "1402519481169720", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499324941_1402519484503053_2505637613869143198_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LK_aigJ_qvEQ7kNvwHesMLV&_nc_oc=AdlLKU1PCbQXwZR0rjjqZFhjlxwugeyeh7hvyyJ2ya6J9YSRhB-aMPzsUpzaG2wqFrc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftHNLA1eTj9mE8fCOW37cZRA2AxJRQyrS0aUuscVWMMwQ&oe=69A81E92"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Video Cover.png", "id": "1723194648306425", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307303_1723194651639758_7252089201199330562_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1yotUij2UBIQ7kNvwHoiL29&_nc_oc=AdkEMK7ognqSRbR6P_53NLYumGD0QVMphO1hJGCz8P_z6fZ1OwKi_CLcnAYl3fAokKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftUu4gEDJeOxo-jfnwHYo_TMvJgGiUvatNCAtiv_vBtUQ&oe=69A81B6C"}, "display_name": "Shopenkraft's Magic Goods", "keywords": ["Shopenkraft", "Shopenkrafts", "Magic", "Goods", "Simulation"], "long_description": "Welcome to **Shopenkraft\u2019s Magic Goods** \u2014 a VR crafting game where your customers are magical, their orders are ridiculous, and **you\u2019re the one stuck fulfilling them**.\nPotions? Sure. Axes? Of course. A glowing tiara made from a suspicious flower and a chunk of crystal? Don\u2019t ask questions.\n\nYou\u2019re the shopkeeper. You brew, forge, enchant, improvise, and occasionally panic. All in a day\u2019s work.\n\n**KEY FEATURES**\n\n- **Brew weird potions** \u2014 Grind rare flowers, spill powder, stir until it bubbles, and hope the customer doesn\u2019t turn into a frog (again).\n- **Forge legendary weapons** \u2014 Melt metal, pour it into a mold, smash it into shape, and pretend you knew what you were doing the whole time.\n- **Craft magical trinkets** \u2014 Combine the wrong ingredients and accidentally invent fashion.\n- **Play your way** \u2014 Go full chaos in Challenge Mode or relax in Cozy Mode (no timers, just vibes).\n- **Unlock stuff** \u2014 Progress through levels to upgrade your shop, discover new ingredients, and unlock even stranger recipes.\n- **Keep going** \u2014 Beat Challenge or Cozy mode to unlock Survival (how long can you last?) and Zen (how long can you chill?).\n\n\n**Your shop. Your mess. Your magical legacy.**\n\n\ud83d\udcac Join our community & send us your weirdest bugs:\n**discord.gg/nbd3vqZxEx**\n\n\n\n**GAME HIGHLIGHTS**\n{556774997233551}\n{1415900346107122}\n{668014879337549}\n{1041171590865899}", "short_description": "Brew potions, forge weapons, enchant stuff. Hope for the best."}]}, "developer_name": "Ingenious Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://shorturl.at/UmUXt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ingenious Studios", "support_website_url": "https://www.ingenious-studios.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.ingenious-studios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25335397286153396"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_1383167826594121_8403992505944360627_n.png?stp=dst-png